<title>USA: Palm Desert RDA, Calif., 6.00 pct yld in 2016.</title>
<headline>Palm Desert RDA, Calif., 6.00 pct yld in 2016.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Redwood Securities Group Inc said Tuesday it priced $19 million of Palm Desert RDA, Calif., tax allocation revenue bonds, Series A and Series B, with a top yield of 6.00 percent in 2016.</p>
<p>The bonds are MBIA insured and rated Aaa by Moody's Investors Service and AAA by Standard &amp; Poor's Corp.</p>
<p>The bonds are dated 10/1/1996 and due 9/1/2002-2011, 2016. The first coupon is 3/1/1997.</p>
<p>The 2002-2011 bonds are callable 9/1/2004 at 102.00, declining to par 2006. The 2016 maturity is callable 9/1/2006 at 102.00 at 2008.</p>
<p>Settlement is expected 10/2/1996.</p>
